 "comment": "Hand-drawn schematic by MBgv (GrizzlyTone posted it) traced from internet photos, 2011-12-26, revised 2012-01-09 with digi2t's corrections, with calculated DC voltages. The drawing has no designators except circled transistor numbers 1-8 (used as Q1-Q8); the other parts are numbered here roughly in signal order. Image 5 is digi2t's (Dino T.) verified vero layout, with its own designators and parts list.",
